# Weapons with flags, in whole fights with violence_update on. In the temple (3001), with Hassan and Smokegod (60):
# - Decimus (10) wields a small sword made sharp, vampiric and poisoned (values 1 2 4 1 140) against a goblin (3501,
#   which parries): sharpness can double a hit, the vampiric bite heals Decimus and makes him a little more evil, and
#   the poison (no affect on the sword, so at its level) can poison the goblin if it fails its save
# - Pickpocket (13, envenom at 85%) envenoms a dagger, and fights a lizard (3710), which resists poison: the
#   dagger's own poison affect sets the level, and weakens with each poisoning until it wears off
# - Rambler (2) wields a sword of 100d100 against a duck: more than 1200 damage is logged as a bug, and the sword is
#   taken away ("You really shouldn't cheat.")
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect pick
Pickpocket
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect ram
Rambler
psswrd
@return
@return
@as dec
@obj 3021 3001 1 2 4 1 140
get sword
wield sword
@mob 3501 3001
kill goblin
@pulse until 600 is DEAD!!
@state
@as pick
@obj 3020 3001
get dagger
envenom dagger
envenom dagger
envenom dagger
wield dagger
@pulse 12
@mob 3710 3001
kill lizard
@pulse until 600 is DEAD!!
@state
@as ram
@obj 3021 3001 1 100 100 1 0
get sword
wield sword
@mob 3124 3001
kill duck
@pulse 12
@state
